<Project>
    <PropertyGroup>
        <!-- NuGet Package Info -->
        <TargetFrameworks>net8.0;net10.0</TargetFrameworks>
        <PackageId>$(MSBuildProjectName)</PackageId>
        <Version>1.5.0</Version>
        <Authors>Andrea Ficarra</Authors>
        <Copyright>Copyright © 2026 Andrea Ficarra</Copyright>
        <Description>Free, open-source (Apache-2.0) MediatR alternative with a MediatR-compatible API: migrate by swapping the package, the namespace and AddMediatR for AddOpenMediatR. Lightweight in-process mediator for .NET supporting requests, streaming requests, notifications, pipeline behaviors, pre/post-processors, exception handlers/actions, and pluggable notification sinks.</Description>
        <PackageProjectUrl>https://adiakys.github.io/OpenMediator/</PackageProjectUrl>
        <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/Adiakys/OpenMediator</RepositoryUrl>
        <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
        <PackageLicenseExpression>Apache-2.0</PackageLicenseExpression>
        <PackageReleaseNotes>
1.5.0:
- Fix: pipeline behaviors now run in registration order, as documented and as in MediatR. The first registered behavior is the outermost. Previously the last registered ran first. Exception handler/action wrappers stay outermost and pre/post-processor wrappers stay innermost. Review the order of AddOpenBehavior calls if you registered more than one behavior.
- RequestHandlerDelegate and StreamHandlerDelegate take an optional CancellationToken, so behaviors written for MediatR can call next() without arguments.
- Send and CreateStream throw an InvalidOperationException that names the request, the handler interface to implement and the registration call to add when no handler is registered.
- XML documentation for the whole public API, shipped in the package for IntelliSense and coding assistants.
- Package metadata: documentation site as project URL, MediatR-alternative description and tags.
- New documentation site: https://adiakys.github.io/OpenMediator/
        </PackageReleaseNotes>
        <PackageTags>mediator;mediatr;mediatr-alternative;cqrs;pipeline;notifications;request-response;streaming;messaging;dotnet;open-source;apache-2.0</PackageTags>
        <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
        <PackageIcon>icon.png</PackageIcon>
        
        <!-- Ship XML docs in the package so IntelliSense and coding agents can read the API documentation -->
        <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>

        <!-- Build and Publish Settings -->
        <GeneratePackageOnBuild>true</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
        <IncludeSymbols>true</IncludeSymbols>
        <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>

    </PropertyGroup>

    <ItemGroup>
        <!-- Optional: Additional files for the NuGet package -->
        <None Include="$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)\..\LICENSE" Pack="true" PackagePath="" />
        <None Include="$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)\..\README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="" />
        <None Include="$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)\..\icon.png" Pack="true" PackagePath="" />
    </ItemGroup>
</Project>
